+# Intelekta Skola — DESIGN.md
+
+Use this file for all UI work on intelektaskola.lv. Every page — homepage included — follows it.
+
+## Idea
+Clean, editorial and trustworthy: a white canvas, navy text, one confident blue. Every piece of content lives in its own white box; important moments (closing calls to action, results, the footer) sit in navy boxes for contrast. Inspired by Claude's editorial style (serif display headings, humanist body text, calm layout) but in the brand's blue taken from the logo.
+
+## Colour
+| Token | Hex | Use |
+|---|---|---|
+| canvas | `#ffffff` | page background |
+| canvas-2 | `#f5f8ff` | inner tiles, subtle bands |
+| tint | `#eef4ff` | badges, icon wells, hover |
+| line | `#e3e9f4` | card borders, dividers |
+| navy | `#0b1530` | headings, contrast boxes, footer |
+| ink | `#334155` | body text |
+| muted | `#5b6785` | secondary text |
+| blue | `#2563eb` | buttons, links, accents |
+| blue-dark | `#1d4ed8` | hover, badge text |
+| blue-light | `#93c5fd` | accents on navy |
+| good | `#047857` | status "Aktīvs" only |
+
+Contrast: body `#334155` on white ≈ 10:1; blue `#2563eb` on white ≈ 5.2:1; light text `#b9c5e4` on navy ≈ 9:1.
+
+## Type
+- Headings (h1, h2): **Source Serif 4**, 700, letter-spacing −0.015em, navy. Highlighted part of a headline: blue gradient `#2563eb → #1e40af`.
+- Body, UI, buttons, h3: **Lexend** 400–700.
+- Labels: Lexend 600, 12px, uppercase, 0.2em tracking, inside a tint pill with a blue dot.
+
+## Boxes
+- Card: white, 1px `line` border, radius 24px (`rounded-3xl`), shadow `0 1px 2px rgba(11,21,48,.04), 0 12px 32px -16px rgba(11,21,48,.18)`. Hover: lift 3px, border `#bcd0f5`, blue shadow.
+- Inner tile: `canvas-2` background, 1px `line` border, radius 16px.
+- Navy box (`.glass-strong`, footer): navy background, white headings, `#b9c5e4` text, light-blue accents; inner tiles become 7% white.
+- Text and buttons always sit inside a box — never loose on the background, except the page hero.
+
+## Buttons
+- Primary: solid blue `#2563eb`, white Lexend 700, pill, soft blue shadow; hover `#1d4ed8`.
+- Secondary: white pill, 1px `#cbd5e1` border, navy text; hover blue border and text.
+- On navy: primary becomes white with navy text.
+
+## Forms
+White fields, 1px `#cbd5e1` border, radius 12px, navy text, `#94a3b8` placeholder; focus: blue border + 3px `rgba(37,99,235,.15)` ring.
+
+## Motion
+Cards fade up 18px on scroll (0.7s, cubic-bezier(.25,0,0,1)); hover lift 0.35s. Disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
+
+## Files
+- `styles/aurora.css` — base components (colours converted to blue by make-blue.py)
+- `styles/theme-light.css` — this light theme, loaded after aurora.css on every page
+- `scripts/site-polish.js` — badges, card hover, scroll reveal, image fallback (inner pages)
